---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import BrandScroll from '../components/BrandScroll.astro';
import ServiceShowcase from '../components/ServiceShowcase.astro';
import ContactBand from '../components/ContactBand.astro';
import GoogleReviews from '../components/GoogleReviews.astro';
import InteractiveMap from '../components/InteractiveMap.astro';
import HeroGlobe from '../components/HeroGlobe.astro';
import {asset} from '../lib/assets';
---
<SiteLayout path="/" title="Managed IT, Infrastructure & Smart Homes in Los Angeles | Tech Judge" description="One local team for your business IT, building infrastructure and smart home. Tech Judge designs, installs and supports technology across Los Angeles.">
 <section class="launch-hero">
  <HeroGlobe/>
  <div class="hero-light" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="hero-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="launch-copy wrap"><h1>Your technology.<br/><em>Our responsibility.</em></h1><p>IT for your business. Infrastructure for your building.<br class="desktop-break"/> Intelligence for your home. A real team behind all of it.</p><div class="launch-actions"><a class="button" href="/contact-us">Let’s talk about your project</a><a class="button button-ghost" href="#explore">Find your service</a></div><p class="hero-local">Based in Chatsworth, working across Southern California.</p></div>
 <section class="proof-ribbon wrap" aria-label="About our team"><p>A small team.<br/><strong>A lot of know-how.</strong></p><div><strong aria-label="35 plus"><span data-count-to="35" aria-hidden="true">35+</span></strong><span>years of combined<br/>leadership experience</span></div><div><strong aria-label="200 plus"><span data-count-to="200" aria-hidden="true">200+</span></strong><span>locations<br/>supported</span></div><div><strong>C7</strong><span>California licensed<br/>#1142144</span></div></section>
  <ServiceShowcase/>
 </section>
 <BrandScroll/>
 <section class="ownership-section wrap">
  <h2 class="statement" data-reveal>Technology gets complicated.<br/><span>Getting help shouldn’t.</span></h2>
  <p class="section-intro" data-reveal>The network. The computers. The cameras. The people using them.<br class="desktop-break"/> We look at how it all works together, then take care of our part.</p>
  <div class="ownership-grid">
<article class="connection-card glass-card ownership-editorial" data-reveal><div class="ownership-copy"><h3>One team.<br/>The whole picture.</h3><p>From the cabling inside the walls to the email on your screen. Fewer handoffs. Clear responsibility.</p></div><div class="ownership-bottom"><div class="ownership-word" aria-hidden="true">One<span>point of contact</span></div><ul class="ownership-coverage"><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="12" rx="1"/><path d="M12 16v4m-4 0h8"/></svg><span>People &amp; everyday IT</span></li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect x="8" y="3" width="8" height="5" rx="1"/><path d="M12 8v5m-7 3v-3h14v3"/><rect x="2" y="16" width="6" height="5" rx="1"/><rect x="16" y="16" width="6" height="5" rx="1"/></svg><span>Networks &amp; infrastructure</span></li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="m12 3 8 3v5c0 5-4 8-8 10-4-2-8-5-8-10V6l8-3Z"/><path d="m8 12 3 3 5-6"/></svg><span>Access &amp; security</span></li></ul></div><a class="text-link" href="/services">See what we take care of</a></article>
   <article class="care-card glass-card" data-reveal><div class="care-symbol support-illustration" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 96 72" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="62" cy="15" r="9"/><path d="M61 30c13 0 21 9 21 21v3"/><circle cx="32" cy="29" r="10"/><path d="M11 66v-5c0-11 9-20 21-20s21 9 21 20v5"/></svg></div><h3>Actual people.<br/>Who know your setup.</h3><p>Not a new introduction every time something goes wrong. For our managed IT clients, we are their IT department.</p><a class="text-link" href="/it-and-cyber-security">Meet your next IT team</a></article>
   <article class="home-window glass-card" data-reveal><img src="/imagery/listening-room.webp" width="1122" height="1402" alt="AI-generated illustration of a warm listening room with discreet audio equipment" loading="lazy"/><div><h3>Beautiful spaces.<br/>Thoughtful technology.</h3><a class="button button-glass" href="/luxury-smart-home">Explore smart homes</a></div></article>
   <article class="scope-card glass-card" data-reveal><div class="scope-sheet" aria-hidden="true"><span>Project scope</span><div><i>✓</i> Site walkthrough</div><div><i>✓</i> Clear recommendations</div><div><i>✓</i> Testing & handover</div></div><h3>Know what you’re getting.</h3><p>We walk the site, explain the options and put the scope in writing. No selling you a system you don’t need.</p><a class="text-link" href="/contact-us?visit=site-walk">Arrange a site walk</a></article>
  </div>
 </section>
 <section class="relationship-section wrap">
  <div class="center-heading" data-reveal><h2>The install is a beginning.<br/><em>Not a goodbye.</em></h2><p>The best measure of our work is being the team clients call again.</p></div>
  <div class="client-stack">
   <article class="client-panel client-primary client-photo-card" data-reveal><img class="client-backdrop" src="/imagery/client-real-estate.webp" width="1672" height="941" alt="" loading="lazy"/><div class="client-panel-top"><span>Ongoing IT & office infrastructure</span><span>Real estate</span></div><h3 class="client-logo client-logo-primary"><img src="/clients/pinnacle-dark.png" alt="Pinnacle Estate Properties" width="1600" height="533" loading="lazy"/></h3><div class="client-panel-bottom"><p>Across their offices, we manage networks, help agents, handle email and VoIP, and build the infrastructure for what’s next.</p><a class="button button-ghost" href="/projects/pinnacle-estate-properties">Inside the relationship</a></div></article>
   <article class="client-panel client-secondary client-photo-card" data-reveal><img class="client-backdrop" src="/imagery/client-escrow.webp" width="1672" height="941" alt="" loading="lazy"/><h3 class="client-logo"><img src="/clients/ridgegate.png" alt="RidgeGate Escrow" width="300" height="91" loading="lazy"/></h3><p>Networks. Servers. Email security.<br/>Support that stays with the business.</p><a class="text-link" href="/projects">See our work</a></article>
   <article class="client-panel client-tertiary client-photo-card" data-reveal><img class="client-backdrop" src="/imagery/client-title.webp" width="1672" height="941" alt="" loading="lazy"/><h3 class="client-logo"><img src="/clients/priority-title.png" alt="Priority Title" width="427" height="94" loading="lazy"/></h3><p>From helping a user to building an office.<br/>The same team behind the technology.</p><a class="text-link" href="/projects">Explore the scope</a></article>
  </div><p class="draft-note">Illustrative AI-generated settings, not photographs of client premises. Client features are pending final publication approval.</p>
 </section>
 <section class="approach-section"><div class="wrap approach-layout"><div class="approach-title"><h2>Good work.<br/>Without the<br/><em>guesswork.</em></h2><p>Here’s what working with us looks like.</p><a class="text-link" href="/about-us">A little more about us</a></div><div class="approach-steps">{[['A conversation, not a pitch.','What’s happening? What do you need? What’s your budget and timeline? We listen before we recommend.'],['A plan you can understand.','We visit the space when needed, explain what’s possible and agree on the work before it begins.'],['The details, finished properly.','Clean cabling. Tested systems. A tidy space. Time to show you how it all works.'],['A clear next step.','For ongoing IT, we stay involved. For a project, we discuss what support makes sense after handover.']].map(([title,copy],i)=><article data-reveal><span class="process-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d={['M4 4h16v12H9l-5 4ZM8 8h8M8 12h5','M7 3h10v3H7ZM5 5H3v17h18V5h-2M7 11h10M7 16h7','m4 13 5 5L20 5','M5 5h7a7 7 0 0 1 0 14H5m4-4-4 4 4 4'][i]}/></svg></span><h3>{title}</h3><p>{copy}</p></article>)}</div></div></section>
 <GoogleReviews/>
 <section class="visit-section wrap" data-reveal><InteractiveMap/><div class="visit-copy"><h2>Local enough<br/>to show up.</h2><p>Based in Chatsworth. Working across the Valley, Thousand Oaks, Santa Clarita and greater Los Angeles.</p><div class="inline-actions"><a class="text-link" href="/service-areas">Where we work</a><a class="text-link" href="tel:+18182132050">(818) 213-2050</a></div></div></section>
 <ContactBand heading="What can we take off your plate?"/>
</SiteLayout>
<script>import '../scripts/count-up';</script>
